<title>PORTUGAL: Lusomundo posts 1.2 bln esc 9-month profit.</title>
<headline>Lusomundo posts 1.2 bln esc 9-month profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ending Sept 30</p>
<p>(In billion escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Set 96</p>
<p>Cons net profit		    1.18 (no comparison)</p>
<p>Operating profit		   1.66</p>
<p>Extraordinaries		    0.79</p>
<p>Net profit after minorities    0.82</p>
<p>Turnover			    26.14 (up 32 percent)</p>
<p>Cashflow			     3.12</p>
<p>Note - Leisure group Lusomundo did not issue consolidated results for the first nine months of 1995.</p>
<p>The company said that its turnover rose 32 percent against the same period last year.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
